ADDITIONAL NOTICE — DEFENSIVE USE

Chrono-DNS is a defensive security tool. It contains traffic *simulators* used
to train and evaluate its own detectors; those simulators generate query
strings against RFC 2606 / RFC 6761 reserved names (.example, .test, .invalid)
and establish no tunnel, transmit no payload, and contain no malware.

Deploy Chrono-DNS only on networks you own or are authorised in writing to
monitor. DNS traffic is personal data in many jurisdictions: consult your legal
and privacy teams, apply an appropriate retention policy (see `fn_prune`), and
tell your users what you are logging.
